                message: "<div> is a static element and should not have interactive event handlers",
                start: 0,
                end: 34,
                help: Some(
                    "**Why:** Non-interactive elements (div, span, etc.) should not have click/keyboard handlers without a role.\n\n**Fix options:**\n\n1. Use a native interactive element:\n```vue\n<button @click=\"handle\">Click me</button>\n```\n\n2. Add role and tabindex:\n```vue\n<div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" @click=\"handle\">\n  Click me\n</div>\n```",
